DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
13064::$$$message_0105_0000_0000$$$::I stop by Mount Miyama on a whim.[lr]::
13065::$$$message_0105_0000_0001$$$::"...Oh?"[lr]::
13066::$$$message_0105_0000_0002$$$::There's Rider. It doesn't seem like she has work today, but... She's acting weird.::
13067::$$$message_0105_0001_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
13068::$$$message_0105_0001_0001$$$::[font italic=true]...Is she buying groceries?[font italic=false][lr]::
13069::$$$message_0105_0001_0002$$$::She's looking back and forth at the products at the storefront and the note in her hand and is scrunching her eyebrows.::
13070::$$$message_0105_0002_0000$$$::"......Ahh."[lr]::
13071::$$$message_0105_0002_0001$$$::She's sighing.[lr]::
13072::$$$message_0105_0002_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01e(遠) textoff=0]It seems like the lady can't help but be curious about Rider too.[lr]::
13073::$$$message_0105_0002_0003$$$::I feel like Rider's shopping won't end until the sun sets at this rate.::
13074::$$$message_0105_0003_0000$$$::"Hey. Rider, are you troubled by something?"[lr]::
13075::$$$message_0105_0003_0001$$$::"Is that you, Shirou!?"[lr]::
13076::$$$message_0105_0003_0002$$$::She must've really been focused on her note.[lr]::
13077::$$$message_0105_0003_0003$$$::For Rider, who usually notices if you enter within her five-meter radius, it's rare how she's surprised like this.::
13078::$$$message_0105_0004_0000$$$::"Oh... Are you shopping too, Shirou?"[lr]::
13079::$$$message_0105_0004_0001$$$::"Yeah. You're also shopping, right?"[lr]::
13080::$$$message_0105_0004_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01e(中) textoff=0]She seems to be disappointed that she's been caught.[lr]::
13081::$$$message_0105_0004_0003$$$::She's acting so timid, which is hard to imagine from the usual dauntless Rider.::
13082::$$$message_0105_0005_0000$$$::"Shirou. May I ask you one thing?"[lr]::
13083::$$$message_0105_0005_0001$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
13084::$$$message_0105_0005_0002$$$::"Since when were you watching me?"[lr]::
13085::$$$message_0105_0005_0003$$$::"Since you seemed to be troubled looking at the note here... Could it be that you're not good at shopping, Rider?"::
13086::$$$message_0105_0006_0000$$$::You couldn't possibly say that she's good at it after watching her.[lr]::
13087::$$$message_0105_0006_0001$$$::Rider stares at me and drops her shoulders.::
13088::$$$message_0105_0007_0000$$$::"No... It would be easy if it were just a lightbulb."[lr]::
13089::$$$message_0105_0007_0001$$$::Come to think of it, when the light went out the day before yesterday, Rider went to go buy it at lightning speed.::
13090::$$$message_0105_0008_0000$$$::"So it means you have a weak point... Could it be food ingredients?"[lr]::
13091::$$$message_0105_0008_0001$$$::"...You saw right through me."[lr]::
13092::$$$message_0105_0008_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01e(中) textoff=0]Rider nods.[lr]::
13093::$$$message_0105_0008_0003$$$::I feel guilty for admiring such a beauty in the middle of the busy street.::
13094::$$$message_0105_0009_0000$$$::"But, you have a list, right?"[lr]::
13095::$$$message_0105_0009_0001$$$::"Yes, Sakura told me what I need to get."[lr]::
13096::$$$message_0105_0009_0002$$$::It shouldn't be hard if there's a shopping list that Sakura, the current leader of the kitchen, made.::
13097::$$$message_0105_0010_0000$$$::"It is this, but..."[lr]::
13098::$$$message_0105_0010_0001$$$::Rider shows me the list.[lr]::
13099::$$$message_0105_0010_0002$$$::It says, "two heads of lettuce" and "chicken" in Sakura's neat handwriting.::
13100::$$$message_0105_0011_0000$$$::"Oh. It's easy if you have this."[lr]::
13101::$$$message_0105_0011_0001$$$::"It must be easy for you since you cook.[lr]::
13102::$$$message_0105_0011_0002$$$::However, it is too vague for someone like me who does not cook."[lr]::
13103::$$$message_0105_0011_0003$$$::[font italic=true]Huh...?[font italic=false][lr]::
13104::$$$message_0105_0011_0004$$$::I don't get what she's trying to say.::
13105::$$$message_0105_0012_0000$$$::"...Well, for example, if it's a tomato..."[lr]::
13106::$$$message_0105_0012_0001$$$::Rider points at bright red tomatoes that are 312 yen for three and 530 yen for six.[lr]::
13107::$$$message_0105_0012_0002$$$::...If I were to choose, then I think I would get the six-pack. There won't be enough for salad if I don't have that much...::
13108::$$$message_0105_0013_0000$$$::"There are differences in the producing area and price, but it is hard for me to decide which one Sakura would prefer."[lr]::
13109::$$$message_0105_0013_0001$$$::"...Isn't the one that's cheaper by unit fine?"[lr]::
13110::$$$message_0105_0013_0002$$$::We aren't that particular when it comes to tomatoes.[lr]::
13111::$$$message_0105_0013_0003$$$::Tohsaka seems to have her own opinion, but I bet Sakura isn't like that.::
13112::$$$message_0105_0014_0000$$$::"Tomatoes and lettuce are still fine. When it comes to potatoes, there's baron potatoes and May Queen potatoes, so it makes me troubled not knowing which food she plans to use them for."::
13113::$$$message_0105_0015_0000$$$::"If this was meat, then there's home-grown and foreign-grown, even within home-grown there's wagyu and brand name, plus there are ones where the price per gram is mixed, and when there are sale items on top of that, I become stunned."[lr]::
13114::$$$message_0105_0015_0001$$$::"...I see. I totally get your worries."[lr]::
13115::$$$message_0105_0015_0002$$$::In other words, it's hard for her to come up with a strategy for shopping when she doesn't have the vision for cooking.::
13116::$$$message_0105_0016_0000$$$::Whether it's going to be steak or stew today.[lr]::
13117::$$$message_0105_0016_0001$$$::Unlike me or Sakura who think of that and can change our strategy, it must be difficult for Rider to guess what the intentions of the upper management must be as a shopping soldier.::
13118::$$$message_0105_0017_0000$$$::"I am glad you understand, Shirou."[lr]::
13119::$$$message_0105_0017_0001$$$::"You must be having a hard time. Oh, but..."[lr]::
13120::$$$message_0105_0017_0002$$$::I remember there's another Servant at our place.[lr]::
13121::$$$message_0105_0017_0003$$$::She goes shopping quite often, but I don't hear about anything similar.::
13122::$$$message_0105_0018_0000$$$::"I don't hear about Saber being troubled about shopping."[lr]::
13123::$$$message_0105_0018_0001$$$::"...Excuse me, but there is a big difference between me and her."[lr]::
13124::$$$message_0105_0018_0002$$$::"What kind of difference?"::
13125::$$$message_0105_0019_0000$$$::"She has a very big appetite. That is why she makes decisions when shopping on a different level.[lr]::
13126::$$$message_0105_0019_0001$$$::...To choose something that looks delicious."[lr]::
13127::$$$message_0105_0019_0002$$$::"Oh..."[lr]::
13128::$$$message_0105_0019_0003$$$::Simple is best.[lr]::
13129::$$$message_0105_0019_0004$$$::That's right, Saber is as honest and straightforward as someone splitting bamboo.[lr]::
13130::$$$message_0105_0019_0005$$$::Of course, that includes the straightforwardness of not taking price into regard.::
13131::$$$message_0105_0020_0000$$$::"...Should I ask Sakura to make a more detailed list next time?"[lr]::
13132::$$$message_0105_0020_0001$$$::"I had her do that once, but that also caused different problems..."::
13133::$$$message_0105_0021_0000$$$::I bet Rider must've been debating intensely whether she should buy something that differs from the conditions of the list.[lr]::
13134::$$$message_0105_0021_0001$$$::If I try to take drastic measures to resolve the situation, that would be...::
13135::$$$message_0105_0022_0000$$$::"You should learn how to cook too, Rider. If you do, then you'll find your own kind of answer."[lr]::
13136::$$$message_0105_0022_0001$$$::"Even if I start learning how to cook, I do not have the confidence in my palate, so I will not be anywhere near as good as you two. Sakura also tells me that I need to learn how..." ::
13137::$$$message_0105_0023_0000$$$::Sakura must be thinking of her as a girl.[lr]::
13138::$$$message_0105_0023_0001$$$::There's no conviction even if I tell Rider to learn how to cook.::
13139::$$$message_0105_0024_0000$$$::"...All right, got it.[lr]::
13140::$$$message_0105_0024_0001$$$::Putting aside whether you'll learn how to cook or not, I'll keep you company. I have some time anyway."[lr]::
13141::$$$message_0105_0024_0002$$$::"...Are you sure, Shirou?"[lr]::
13142::$$$message_0105_0024_0003$$$::"Yeah. I also use the things in the refrigerator, so it would be better if we bought it together rather than separately, right?"::
13143::$$$message_0105_0025_0000$$$::Besides, I'd also be able to teach her detailed techniques if we go shopping together.[lr]::
13144::$$$message_0105_0025_0001$$$::How to choose vegetables, meat, when to aim for the sale, etc. There are a lot of things that would become easier just by knowing.::
13145::$$$message_0105_0026_0000$$$::"...I'm glad. I appreciate it, Shirou."[lr]::
13146::$$$message_0105_0026_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01c(中) textoff=0]Rider stretches and bows politely.::
13147::$$$message_0105_0027_0000$$$::"I will definitely return the favor another time."[lr]::
13148::$$$message_0105_0027_0001$$$::"You don't have to be that formal. It's just shopping for groceries."[lr]::
13149::$$$message_0105_0027_0002$$$::...How troubling, I'm a bit embarrassed.[lr]::
13150::$$$message_0105_0027_0003$$$::It's rare to be depended on by such a timid Rider.::
13151::$$$message_0105_0028_0000$$$::"...What is wrong? Your face is red, Shirou."[lr]::
13152::$$$message_0105_0028_0001$$$::"N-Nothing."[lr]::
13153::$$$message_0105_0028_0002$$$::"Could it be that you are blushing like this when you go shopping with Sakura, too?"[lr]::
13154::$$$message_0105_0028_0003$$$::"I said it's nothing, [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]I mean it!"::
13155::$$$message_0105_0029_0000$$$::"...I hope so.[lr]::
13156::$$$message_0105_0029_0001$$$::Then let us get the things that are easy to reach first. First is vegetables, but..."[lr]::
13157::$$$message_0105_0029_0002$$$::"Got it[line len=3]Let's get moving."::
913082::$$$message_9105_0005_0000$$$::"Shirou. May I ask you one thing?"[r]::

